            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P1 · Database Saturation Is Impacting Applications — CONFIRMED\n**WHAT:** Connection-pool saturation forecasts are P3 capacity work. The same forecast while queries on that instance are already slowing is an outage in progress: the pool is not just filling, it is failing to drain.\n**WHY THIS IS DIFFERENT:** every member condition below is true at the same time, which is what separates a real incident from an isolated symptom:\n  - Database Connection Pool Saturation Forecast\n  - Database Query Latency Anomaly\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod`\n**SERVICE / SCOPE:** `database-platform` (database)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Confirmed impact: every member condition is true simultaneously, which is the evidence threshold this platform requires before paging on a symptom.\n**OWNER:** data-engineering · pages the on-call rotation\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Treat as a confirmed incident. The member alerts are the evidence trail; the runbook's remediation section applies directly.\n**RUNBOOK:** https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/db-connection-saturation.md\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-database`.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-database-availability`\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Database Saturation Is Impacting Applications\nAt least one member condition cleared, so the confirmed-impact state no longer holds. Individual member monitors may still be alerting — check before closing the incident.\n{{/is_recovery}}",
