            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P2 · Checkout Payment Latency\n**WHAT:** checkout-payment-latency: custom monitor requested by payments.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `checkout-api` (api / service, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Service-specific impact declared by the owning team; see the runbook.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** The platform pack applies api-latency-p99 (rate-of-change) to every API. Checkout has a strong weekly traffic shape — Monday morning and Friday evening peaks are 4x the trough — so rate-of-change produces recurring false positives at the shoulders of each peak. `predictive.anomaly: true` selects the seasonal variant (robust/weekly) for THIS service only, which learns the shape instead of reacting to it. The pack monitor stays in place for every other API.\n\n**OWNER:** payments · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Open the runbook. This monitor was requested by payments for a service-specific condition, so the owning team's runbook is authoritative.\n**RUNBOOK:** https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/api-latency-p99.md\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-api-health` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `api-services.prod.checkout-api` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-api-latency` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Checkout Payment Latency — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P2. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/api-latency-p99.md\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Checkout Payment Latency — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/api-latency-p99.md\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Checkout Payment Latency\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-api-latency`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
