            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P1 · Settlement Partner File Sla\n**WHAT:** Settlement partner file has not arrived within the contractual window.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `nightly-settlement` (integration / integration_flow, tier1)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Finance close and customer statement generation both block on this file. Missing the window means the close slips a day and statements are late to every customer in the batch.\n\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** Fixed threshold approved: the 02:00 delivery time and the 5-hour breach point are contractual terms in the settlement partner agreement, not a statistical property of the feed. The platform archetype uses 26 hours, which is correct as a generic default and useless as a finance-close guardrail.\n\n**OWNER:** payments · support 24x7 · this pages the on-call rotation\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Open the runbook. This monitor was requested by payments for a service-specific condition, so the owning team's runbook is authoritative.\n**RUNBOOK:** https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/partner-file-delivery-missed.md\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-dependency` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `nightly-settlement.prod.nightly-settlement` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-integration-delivery` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Settlement Partner File Sla — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P1. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/partner-file-delivery-missed.md\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Settlement Partner File Sla — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/partner-file-delivery-missed.md\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Settlement Partner File Sla\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-integration-delivery`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "5",
                "critical_recovery": "",
