            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P4 · Azure Integration Stopped Delivering Metrics\n**WHAT:** Azure Integration Stopped Delivering Metrics: telemetry_health signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `platform-services` (cloud / azure_subscription, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Observability or configuration hygiene is degraded. No direct customer impact, but our ability to see or govern the estate is reduced.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** A silent Azure integration makes every cloud monitor silently green. This is the tripwire that prevents false confidence.\n\n**OWNER:** cloud-engineering · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Open the runbook, confirm scope from the group tags, and follow the validation steps. The attached workflow output already contains the standard diagnostics.\n**RUNBOOK:** https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/azure-integration-telemetry-gap.md\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-azure-resource` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `azure-landing-zone.prod.platform-services` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-platform-services` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Azure Integration Stopped Delivering Metrics — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P4. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/azure-integration-telemetry-gap.md\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Azure Integration Stopped Delivering Metrics — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/m