            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P1 · Data Product Freshness Breach\n**WHAT:** Data Product Freshness Breach: freshness signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `data-platform` (data / data_product, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Customers are affected now, or a mission-critical capability is unavailable.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** Freshness SLAs are contractual with the consuming business unit. The threshold IS the agreement (2h for operational marts).\n\n**OWNER:** data-engineering · support 24x7 · this pages the on-call rotation\n**DO THIS NEXT:** Open the runbook, confirm scope from the group tags, and follow the validation steps. The attached workflow output already contains the standard diagnostics.\n**RUNBOOK:** https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/pipeline-output-stale.md\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-data-pipeline` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `data-pipelines.prod.data-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-data-freshness` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Data Product Freshness Breach — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P1. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/pipeline-output-stale.md\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Data Product Freshness Breach — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one. Runbook: https://github.com/droderiquesit/enterprise-observability/blob/main/platform/runbooks/pipeline-output-stale.md\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Data Product Freshness Breach\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-data-freshness`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
